<title>USA: Delaware Medical Center changes name to Christiana.</title>
<headline>Delaware Medical Center changes name to Christiana.</headline>
<dateline>DOVER, Del. 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medical Center of Delaware said it changed its name to Christiana Care Health System.</p>
<p>The center's parent company, M-C-D Foundation, also officially adopted the name.</p>
<p>The change applies to all of the foundation's holdings, which include Visiting Nurse's Association of Delaware, M-C-D Holding Co, and Health Services Corp.</p>
<p>Officials said the name change takes effect immediately.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
